<!DOCTYPE HTML><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><META name="GENERATOR" content="IBM HomePage Builder 2001 V5.0.0 for Windows"><meta name="msvalidate.01" content="3BB4D18369B9C21326AF7A99FCCC5A09" /><meta property="fb:app_id" content="537395183072744" /><title>O2A2 2026 - Only One of Any Asset Visual Novel Jam - itch.io</title><meta name="csrf_token" value="WyIwNlNRIiwxNzg1NjczODIzLCJXTnBGNGhCMGtkcW95OFkiXQ==.JmH1G/v+LQfXsJ8N1DR6M46zHo0=" /><meta content="O2A2 2026 - Only One of Any Asset Visual Novel Jam" property="og:title"/><meta content="itch.io" property="og:site_name"/><meta content="4503599627724030" property="twitter:account_id"/><link rel="manifest" href="/static/manifest.json"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@context":"http:\/\/schema.org","itemListElement":[{"item":{"@id":"https:\/\/itch.io\/jams","name":"Jams"},"position":1,"@type":"ListItem"}]}</script><meta content="summary_large_image" name="twitter:card"/><meta content="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3NjU1NTc3LmpwZw==/original/ugWj8Z.jpg" property="twitter:image"/><meta content="@itchio" name="twitter:site"/><meta content="O2A2 2026 - Only One of Any Asset Visual Novel Jam" name="twitter:title"/><meta content="A game jam from 2026-07-11 to 2026-07-21 hosted by Stella @ MakeVisualNovels. Announcement The &quot;Only One of Any Asset&quot; (O2A2) Visual Novel Jam is back again for 2026! The team building Meet &amp; Greet will be hosted in the DevTalk..." name="twitter:description"/><meta content="A game jam from 2026-07-11 to 2026-07-21 hosted by Stella @ MakeVisualNovels. Announcement The &quot;Only One of Any Asset&quot; (O2A2) Visual Novel Jam is back again for 2026! The team building Meet &amp; Greet will be hosted in the DevTalk..." property="og:description"/><meta content="A game jam from 2026-07-11 to 2026-07-21 hosted by Stella @ MakeVisualNovels. Announcement The &quot;Only One of Any Asset&quot; (O2A2) Visual Novel Jam is back again for 2026! The team building Meet &amp; Greet will be hosted in the DevTalk..." name="description"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><meta content="#FA5C5C" name="theme-color"/><meta content="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3NjU1NTc3LmpwZw==/original/ugWj8Z.jpg" property="og:image"/><link href="https://static.itch.io/jam.css?1785642729" rel="stylesheet"/><script type="text/javascript">window.itchio_translations_url = 'https://static.itch.io/translations';</script><script src="https://static.itch.io/lib.min.js?1785642729" type="text/javascript"></script><script src="https://static.itch.io/bundle.min.js?1785642729" type="text/javascript"></script><script data-src="https://static.itch.io/react.min.js?1785642729" id="lib_react_src"></script><script src="https://static.itch.io/jam.min.js?1785642729" type="text/javascript"></script><script type="text/javascript">I.current_user = null;</script><script type="text/javascript">if (!window.location.hostname.match(/localhost/)) {      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
